{"steam_appid":3526710,"steam_name":"Everything is Crab: The Animal Evolution Roguelite","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3526710/190344142/b7cc03ad5aa41ef73949cf6df0efa7d732d0fc9b/1777635239/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1778230107","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257325684/0c8f3f73f9277849d4ff08122d7cd19000d69c5f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1778230107","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/5fa05d45518afef63df640c1f997564a3f2bda6a/ss_5fa05d45518afef63df640c1f997564a3f2bda6a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786620394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/791a102dc795eefc9c91177e7933d0d6894a2156/ss_791a102dc795eefc9c91177e7933d0d6894a2156.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786620394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/811fbfef368f7fe889f80e8bd935c0ea0e4a5ad1/ss_811fbfef368f7fe889f80e8bd935c0ea0e4a5ad1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786620394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/360c29e6d9fea0db3ee9265d68e5102e9673af15/ss_360c29e6d9fea0db3ee9265d68e5102e9673af15.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786620394","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/a4b71b9d31972a5356359473a10090d7427b204f/ss_a4b71b9d31972a5356359473a10090d7427b204f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786620394"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/f4d8280666801f227724f84407e67491.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;The Animal Evolution Roguelite&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a <strong>living ecosystem</strong>, 'Everything is Crab' is a <strong>cute, challenging, highly replayable action roguelite</strong>. Make animal inspired <strong>evolutionary choices</strong> to concoct your own unique creature every run, both mechanically and visually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's <strong>Spore </strong>meets <strong>Modern Roguelites</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.poster.avif?t=1786620394\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing different player evolutions running through grassy, desert, and snowy environments, dodging attacks from different critters. Pop-up menus reveal different Evolution options (applying scales, more mass, or sharpened claws), and bonus activations (the Mud Pond choice letting players select from decreased damage with &#039;mud bath&#039;, increased hot and cold resistance with &#039;thermoregulate&#039;, or increased social stats with &#039;scent marking&#039;).\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.webm?t=1786620394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/88caa06ab1c3af489112685f32357e59.mp4?t=1786620394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/859ef9ea2f0284d5756305d9056d567c.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Beat Carcinisation&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As everybody knows, eventually, every organism ends up evolving into a crab. Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, except for you. Choose your own evolutionary path and strategy to thrive and defeat convergent evolution. Take that, science!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.poster.avif?t=1786620394\" aria-label=\"GIF showing a variety of different player evolutions, with the character gaining horns, tentacles, bat wings, snail cones, scorpion stingers, eyes-on-stalks, and more.\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/e1bb1acb0fc0b187543844a45c8649ca.webm?t=1786620394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/56b7b89a5b82b9c4707f4ef2c629599f.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Evolve, Adapt, Overcome&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 125 abilities combine to create a plethora of different builds and playstyles: Become a wily trickster, a ferocious predator, a gregarious leader, a nimble nomad, or take on any number of other survival strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legs! Claws! Pincers! Wings! More Legs! Fur! Tail! Scales! Tentacles! I SAID MORE LEGS!!! <br>Build your formidable, visually awkward chimera or get Darwin'd in the process.                                           </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.poster.avif?t=1786620394\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video showing three different boss characters attacking in a variety of biomes: one a cow/crab hybrid, one an elephant-like creature with a shell on its back, and on a wasp-like creation with crab claws.\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.webm?t=1786620394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/05f69e26d3f685da86e109a34cc8ca94.mp4?t=1786620394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/15439ac1fdec62e9c558930d66abd000.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Section Header with text &amp;quot;Features&amp;quot;\" width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>125+ evolution based abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities and visual combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy-defining evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many viable survival strategies and playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/2b990ccfd94bdf71f1f3d51e3707fdff.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a cow.\" width=148 height=148 /></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/75b4807fbab84baa5cb7591092e59dbe.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a sloth.\" width=148 height=148 /></span>          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/9434e9c8d62d0b7f4ada9df94d503159.avif?t=1786620394\" alt=\"Pixel art portrait of a camel.\" width=148 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living, thriving ecosystem</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different critters with their own goals and strategies, each of them with several stages of evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct biomes with different rules, climate events, points of interest, flora and fauna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night and day cycle          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.poster.avif?t=1786620394\" aria-label=\"Idle animation of the Crabtaur boss - a cow/crab hybrid.\" width=512 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/1c151d8ad85ecb6dd3e2b1008dcdb911.webm?t=1786620394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of bosses that may (or may not) appear with each run</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge meta-progression layer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulties system (if you dare!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetics (starting Characters), which can be combined to create endless starting character combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Scenarios to push your adaptation skills to the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More evolutions</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless runs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your survival skills to unlock Endless runs, ditch the timer, and outlast the apocalypse! </p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your findings, meta-progression and achievements in the Codex</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.apng?t=1786620394\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526710/extras/c65d8d511265f0086e4320b607fca173.poster.avif?t=1786620394\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"A bouncing hare.\" width=256 height=140 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Have a Crabby day!</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 ghz with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  DX11, DX12 capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5 ghz with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  DX11, DX12 capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Odd Dreams Digital"],"publishers":["Secret Mode"],"release_date":"8 May, 2026"}